  "body": "## [4.44.14](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/compare/v4.44.13...v4.44.14) (2026-11-17)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **ci:** complete bounded maintenance source verification ([3aafeda](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/3aafeda8ed2b2befa0f49c78fe0b5c88c79d7f1c))\n* **ci:** distinguish workflow registry labels from source identity ([e0cb404](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/e0cb4043fceda690457203f0895ea982a5ebbfd9))\n* **ci:** merge the qualified 4.44 maintenance catalog ([51d56ec](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/51d56ec722e0e66c8957f2f7502015f2c9b7c5c1))\n* **deps:** support the patched 4.44 maintenance catalog ([7b95a68](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/7b95a68fa0657135cee1103defc59089defa93ff))\n* **release:** merge maintenance carrier provenance checks ([979cfd3](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/979cfd3e2c4145be516fbd833dacfc6b8e8fdce5))\n* **release:** retain exact maintenance producer carriers ([4a7e0d2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/4a7e0d22e79aeb26f73fd4b147cd4edece8e4f26))\n"
